  "thag1.111:1.1": "Duppabbajjaṃ ve, duradhivāsā gehā, ",
  "thag1.111:1.2": "dhammo gambhīro, duradhigamā bhogā; ",
  "thag1.111:1.3": "kicchā vutti no itarītaren' eva; ",
  "thag1.111:1.4": "yuttaṃ cintetuṃ satatam aniccatan ",
  "thag1.111:1.5": "ti. Tevijjo 'haṃ "
}
